-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ב/5 (10.2.2022), עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 לעובדי הוראה.
-- The CPI update, from 1.1.2022, of the 2016 shekel supplement for teaching
-- employees in kindergartens, primary schools, junior high schools and
-- teacher-training colleges: who it applies to, the full-position amount
-- by Ofek Hadash grade, and when it is paid.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשפ"ב/5 עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 לעובדי הוראה`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p2 akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/p4 akn:hc_1/p5 akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/p7 The letterhead, the date and the reference number; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p8 akn:hc_1/p9 akn:hc_1/p10 akn:hc_1/p11 akn:hc_1/p12 The circular's number, the addressees, the greeting and the subject line; no rule.

§§ `The indexation`

-- ¶13 names the sources: the wage agreements with the Teachers' Union of
-- 30.9.2016 (§6ד) and 19.3.2017, and circulars תשע"ז/3, תשע"ח/6, תשע"ט/4,
-- תש"פ/4. Its rule: the supplement is linked to the CPI. The index values
-- are not printed; they are inputs.
@ref akn:hc_1/p13
GIVEN `amount set by the agreements` IS A NUMBER @desc the supplement as the collective agreements set it, before indexation
      `index of the update`          IS A NUMBER @desc the consumer price index the update is made to
      `index of the base`            IS A NUMBER @desc the consumer price index the agreements' amount stands at
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the supplement linked to the CPI` `amount set by the agreements` `index of the update` `index of the base` IS
    `to the agora` (`amount set by the agreements` TIMES (`index of the update` DIVIDED BY `index of the base`))

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `to the agora` x IS
    ROUND (x TIMES 100) DIVIDED BY 100

@desc A consumer price index by the month it measures (the index is published the month after).
DECLARE `consumer price index` IS ONE OF
    `the index of December 2019`
    `the index of December 2021`

-- ¶14: the circular governs the period from 1 January 2022 onward. ¶15: the
-- update is to the December 2021 index (published January 2022) against the
-- December 2019 index (published January 2020).
@ref akn:hc_1/p14 akn:hc_1/p15
`the index the update is made to` MEANS `the index of December 2021`
`the index the update is measured against` MEANS `the index of December 2019`

§§ `תחולה`

-- akn:hc_1/p16 The heading "תחולה" (scope); no rule.

@desc The stages of education ¶17 names, and any other.
DECLARE `stage of education` IS ONE OF
    `kindergarten`
    `primary school`
    `junior high school`
    `teacher-training college`
    `another stage`

@desc A teaching employee as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `shekel supplement employee` HAS
    `rated on the teaching-employee scale`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by an owner of a supervised institution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by an owner of educational institutions the Ministry of Education supervises
    `stage employed in`                                IS A `stage of education`
    `employed under Ofek Hadash`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `placed on the Ofek Hadash teachers' tables`       IS A BOOLEAN @desc placed in a grade of the Ofek Hadash salary tables for academic and non-academic teachers
    `Ofek Hadash grade`                                IS A NUMBER  @desc the grade on those tables (half grades such as 1.5 exist); read only when placed on them

-- ¶17: who the circular applies to. ¶18: whether or not under Ofek Hadash
-- (the reform is no condition, so it does not appear here).
@ref akn:hc_1/p17 akn:hc_1/p18
GIVEN e IS A `shekel supplement employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` e IF
        e's `rated on the teaching-employee scale`
    AND e's `employed by an owner of a supervised institution`
    AND NOT e's `stage employed in` EQUALS `another stage`

§§ `א. The amounts from 1.1.2022`

@desc One printed row of section א: an Ofek Hadash grade and the full-position monthly amount from 1.1.2022.
DECLARE `grade row` HAS
    `grade of the row`  IS A NUMBER
    `amount of the row` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:hc_1__para_a/p1 akn:hc_1__para_a/p2 akn:hc_1__para_a/p3 akn:hc_1__para_a/p4 akn:hc_1__para_a/p5
`the amounts by Ofek Hadash grade from 1.1.2022` MEANS
    LIST `grade row` 1   1114.46,
         `grade row` 1.5 1049.22,
         `grade row` 2   983.98,
         `grade row` 2.5 905.02,
         `grade row` 3   826.07,
         `grade row` 3.5 783.80,
         `grade row` 4   741.53,
         `grade row` 4.5 652.43

-- ¶6: every other teaching employee the circular applies to, under Ofek
-- Hadash or not.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_a/p6
`the amount for every other teaching employee from 1.1.2022` MEANS 563.60

GIVEN e IS A `shekel supplement employee`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the grade rows that name` e IS
    IF e's `placed on the Ofek Hadash teachers' tables`
    THEN map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `amount of the row`)
             (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `grade of the row` EQUALS e's `Ofek Hadash grade`)
                     `the amounts by Ofek Hadash grade from 1.1.2022`)
    ELSE EMPTY

@export The monthly 2016 shekel supplement from 1 January 2022 for a full-position teaching employee in kindergartens, primary schools, junior high schools and teacher-training colleges, under circular תשפ"ב/5
GIVEN e IS A `shekel supplement employee` @desc the employee
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full-position shekel supplement 2016` e IS
    IF NOT `the circular applies to` e
    THEN 0
    ELSE CONSIDER `the grade rows that name` e
         WHEN x FOLLOWED BY rest THEN x
         OTHERWISE `the amount for every other teaching employee from 1.1.2022`

-- ¶19-20: every other rule for paying the supplement (part-time positions
-- among them) is in circular תשע"ז/3, which this file does not encode; the
-- share of a full position the supplement is paid at is an input from there.
@ref akn:hc_1/p19 akn:hc_1/p20
GIVEN e IS A `shekel supplement employee`
      `share paid under circular תשע"ז/3` IS A NUMBER @desc the share of the full-position amount payable to the employee under the rules of circular תשע"ז/3
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the shekel supplement 2016 payable` e `share paid under circular תשע"ז/3` IS
    `to the agora` (`the full-position shekel supplement 2016` e TIMES `share paid under circular תשע"ז/3`)

§§ `Payment and reimbursement`

DECLARE `supplement action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the updated supplement` HAS `amount paid` IS A NUMBER, `with arrears for January 2022` IS A BOOLEAN
    `reimburse the owner at the hour cost in the payment system`

-- ¶21: pay from January 2022's salary and no later than February 2022's,
-- with arrears for January. Time is in school months (common.l4: January
-- is 5, February 6).
@ref akn:hc_1/p21
GIVEN e IS A `shekel supplement employee`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supplement action`
DECIDE `paying the updated supplement` e IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the updated supplement` amount arrears
          PROVIDED amount AT LEAST `the full-position shekel supplement 2016` e AND arrears
    WITHIN `month number` February
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ב/5: the updated supplement is paid no later than February 2022's salary, with arrears for January"

@ref akn:hc_1/p21
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supplement action`
DECIDE `reimbursement for the shekel supplement` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owner at the hour cost in the payment system`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: the signatures of the two officials and the list of copies; no rule.

-- Examples.
`a grade 2.5 primary teacher` MEANS
    `shekel supplement employee` WITH
        `rated on the teaching-employee scale`             IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner of a supervised institution` IS TRUE
        `stage employed in`                                IS `primary school`
        `employed under Ofek Hadash`                       IS TRUE
        `placed on the Ofek Hadash teachers' tables`       IS TRUE
        `Ofek Hadash grade`                                IS 2.5

`a grade 7 kindergarten teacher` MEANS
    `shekel supplement employee` TRUE TRUE `kindergarten` TRUE TRUE 7

`a teacher outside the reform` MEANS
    `shekel supplement employee` TRUE TRUE `junior high school` FALSE FALSE 0

`an upper-division teacher` MEANS
    `shekel supplement employee` TRUE TRUE `another stage` TRUE TRUE 1

#ASSERT `the full-position shekel supplement 2016` `a grade 2.5 primary teacher` EQUALS 905.02
#ASSERT `the full-position shekel supplement 2016` `a grade 7 kindergarten teacher` EQUALS 563.60
#ASSERT `the full-position shekel supplement 2016` `a teacher outside the reform` EQUALS 563.60
#ASSERT `the full-position shekel supplement 2016` `an upper-division teacher` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the shekel supplement 2016 payable` `a grade 2.5 primary teacher` 0.5 EQUALS 452.51

-- The printed grades are distinct, so no grade is given two amounts, and the
-- amount falls as the grade rises.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `grade of the row` EQUALS g) `the amounts by Ofek Hadash grade from 1.1.2022`) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST 1, 1.5, 2, 2.5, 3, 3.5, 4, 4.5)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD `amount at grade` (fst p) GREATER THAN `amount at grade` (snd p))
            (zip (LIST 1, 1.5, 2, 2.5, 3, 3.5, 4) (LIST 1.5, 2, 2.5, 3, 3.5, 4, 4.5))

GIVEN g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `amount at grade` g IS
    `the full-position shekel supplement 2016` (`shekel supplement employee` TRUE TRUE `primary school` TRUE TRUE g)

#TRACE `paying the updated supplement` `a grade 2.5 primary teacher` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the updated supplement` 905.02 TRUE AT 6
